*> Implementation test of the container packet bodies of proto/src/containers.cob (05a 0x12 Set
*> Content, 0x14 Set Slot, 0x3C Open Screen; 05c 0x12 Click, 0x13 Close; 00 §12.4 HashedStack):
*> values the writer cannot encode append nothing and set PB-ERROR; a failed read leaves PB-POS
*> where it was and yields zeros. The packet ids are the callers'. A Set Cursor Item body is the
*> item stack of test_item_stack.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-CONTAINERS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 64.
 01 WS-HEX                 PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-EDIT                PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CONTAINER           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-STATE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BUTTON              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CLICK-TYPE          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MENU                BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "PB-INIT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
     PERFORM SET-SLOT-CASES
     PERFORM CONTENT-CASES
     PERFORM CLICK-CASES
     PERFORM HASHED-CASES
     PERFORM SCREEN-CASES
     PERFORM CLOSE-CASES
     CALL "PB-FREE" USING PB-BUFFER
     STOP RUN.

 SET-SLOT-CASES.
