     MOVE 2 TO WS-CONTAINER
     MOVE 300 TO WS-STATE
     MOVE 45 TO WS-SLOT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-BUTTON
     MOVE 0 TO WS-CLICK-TYPE
     MOVE 1 TO WS-COUNT
