     PERFORM END-FIELDS
     MOVE "02 01 0001 00 00 8101" TO WS-HEX
     PERFORM FILL
     CALL "PB-GET-CONTAINER-CLICK-HEAD" USING PB-BUFFER WS-CONTAINER WS-STATE WS-SLOT
